---
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---
<div class="redes">
  <aside class="zap" aria-labelledby="zap-titulo">
    <div class="zap-icone" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
        <path d="M20.5 3.5A11 11 0 0 0 2.1 17.2L1 23l6-1.6A11 11 0 0 0 20.5 3.5zM12 20.2a9.1 9.1 0 0 1-4.6-1.3l-.3-.2-3.6.9.9-3.5-.2-.3A9.1 9.1 0 1 1 12 20.2zm5-6.8c-.3-.1-1.6-.8-1.8-.9s-.4-.1-.6.1-.7.9-.8 1-.3.2-.6.1a7.4 7.4 0 0 1-2.2-1.4 8.2 8.2 0 0 1-1.5-1.9c-.2-.3 0-.4.1-.6l.4-.5.2-.3a.5.5 0 0 0 0-.5c0-.1-.6-1.4-.8-1.9s-.4-.4-.6-.4h-.5a1 1 0 0 0-.7.3 3 3 0 0 0-.9 2.2 5.2 5.2 0 0 0 1.1 2.8 11.9 11.9 0 0 0 4.6 4.1c1.6.6 2.2.7 3 .6a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 1.7-1.2 2 2 0 0 0 .1-1.2c-.1-.1-.3-.2-.6-.3z" />
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="zap-texto">
      <h2 id="zap-titulo">Acompanhe a curadoria no WhatsApp</h2>
      <p>Entre no grupo do Cupons.blog para ver os cupons e as ofertas que conferimos.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="btn" href={SITE.whatsappGrupo} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      Entrar no grupo de WhatsApp
    </a>
  </aside>
  <aside class="zap zap-ig" aria-labelledby="ig-titulo">
